# Git backup for this Obsidian vault (local only, no remote).
# Purpose: review and roll back changes (especially AI edits) to notes and settings.
# Track text only. Course files (PDF, Office, media) stay out of git; the
# _Organizer archives and Time Machine cover those.

# 1) Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...but look inside folders
!*/

# 2) Track these text formats
!*.md
!*.base
!*.canvas
!*.css
!*.json
!*.py
!13 Calendar/System/**/*.js
!.gitignore

# 3) Re-ignore noise, caches, per-device state and secrets
._*
.DS_Store
~$*
.trash/
.smart-env/
.obsidian/workspace*.json
.obsidian/cache/
.obsidian/backup-before-starter-2026-09-28/
.obsidian/plugins/*/main.js
!.obsidian/plugins/graph-groups/main.js
!.obsidian/plugins/graph-groups/manifest.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/manifest.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/styles.css
# REST API keys and certificates must never be committed
.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-local-rest-api/
.obsidian/plugins/smart-connections/
.claude/settings.local.json
